<title>USA: 3-D GeoPhysical Q4 hurt by margins, costs.</title>
<headline>3-D GeoPhysical Q4 hurt by margins, costs.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>3-D Geophysical Inc said Thursday its fourth quarter results were hurt by costs related to a postponed contract in Peru, lower margins at its Mexican operations, and higher costs in the United States.</p>
<p>On a proforma basis, assuming all of the company's operations were acquired on January 1, 1995, 3-D Geophysical posted a fourth quarter loss of $0.15 per share versus a profit of $0.04 per share a year earlier.</p>
</text>
